; Leg DN -- the host SENDS.  The Victor RECEIVES 32 KB at 38400.
;
; THE NULL LEG.  Shipping build, no switch: flow control is compiled in and
; switched off, so this leg has to reproduce SS16ai leg CE / SS16ah leg BC
; and say that the machine, the cable and the harness are behaving before
; anything else in the sitting is attributed to anything.
;
; PASS:  rxlost=0 rxfull=0, rxpeak 2,4xx-2,6xx of 4096, 18 packets,
;        0 retransmissions, 0 timeouts, rxbytes ~37,55x, byte-exact.
;        On the "v9k: flow" line: in=0 out=0 hi=65535, every counter 0.
;
; "set flow none" is deliberate and it is also what makes the mdm cts=
; reading in STEPDN.OUT evidence -- the host holds RTS asserted only
; because it is not using it (SS16v).  DO NOT change it on this leg.
;
; Reconcile afterwards:
;   python3 v9k/tools/pktstat.py --rxbytes <from STEPDN.OUT> s16ajDN.pkt
; Residual -11 clean, +28 with a startup timeout, anything else means the
; two ends did not see the same transfer.

set speed 38400
set receive timeout 20
set retry 30
set parity none
set flow none
set prefixing cautious
set block 3
log packets s16ajDN.pkt
send rcvdn.dat
statistics
